          "text": "{\"questions\":[{\"scenario\":\"At a café dessert counter, you want to start by politely asking for the menu.\",\"prompt\":\"Ask for the menu politely.\",\"context\":\"In a café, you want to see what sweet options are available.\",\"spokenPrompt\":\"메뉴 좀 보여 주세요.\",\"choices\":[{\"hangul\":\"메뉴 좀 보여 주세요.\",\"romanization\":\"menyu jom boyeo juseyo.\"},{\"hangul\":\"메뉴 주세요.\",\"romanization\":\"menyu juseyo.\"},{\"hangul\":\"메뉴 있어요?\",\"romanization\":\"menyu isseoyo?\"}],\"correctAnswerIndex\":0,\"translation\":\"Please show me the menu.\",\"explanation\":\"주세요 = please give me\",\"teachingPoint\":\"주세요 = please give me\",\"explanationNarration\":\"Use 요청하는 정중한 표현. Show interest in options available.\"},{\"scenario\":\"At the counter\",\"prompt\":\"Order a slice of cake.\",\"context\":\"You want a single piece of cake.\",\"spokenPrompt\":\"케이크 한 조각 주세요.\",\"choices\":[{\"hangul\":\"케이크 한 조각 주세요.\",\"romanization\":\"keikeu han jogak juseyo.\"},{\"hangul\":\"케이크 주세요.\",\"romanization\":\"keikeu juseyo.\"},{\"hangul\":\"케이크 맛있어요?\",\"romanization\":\"keikeu masisseoyo?\"}],\"correctAnswerIndex\":0,\"translation\":\"One slice of cake, please.\",\"explanation\":\"한 조각 = one piece\",\"teachingPoint\":\"한 조각 주세요 shows quantity\",\"explanationNarration\":\"A precise request helps staff prepare the right amount.\"},{\"scenario\":\"At the counter\",\"prompt\":\"Ask for a fork.\",\"context\":\"You want a fork to share your cake.\",\"spokenPrompt\":\"포크 하나 주세요.\",\"choices\":[{\"hangul\":\"포크 하나 주세요.\",\"romanization\":\"pokeu hana juseyo.\"},{\"hangul\":\"포크 빼 주세요.\",\"romanization\":\"pokeu ppae juseyo.\"},{\"hangul\":\"포크 있어요?\",\"romanization\":\"pokeu isseoyo?\"}],\"correctAnswerIndex\":0,\"translation\":\"One fork, please.\",\"explanation\":\"하나 주세요 = one, please\",\"teachingPoint\":\"하나 주세요 = please give me one item\",\"explanationNarration\":\"Ask for a utensil politely to avoid confusion at the counter.\"},{\"scenario\":\"At the counter\",\"prompt\":\"Ask whether the dessert contains nuts.\",\"context\":\"You have an allergy to nuts and need to check ingredients.\",\"spokenPrompt\":\"이 디저트에 견과류가 들어 있나요?\",\"choices\":[{\"hangul\":\"이 디저트에 견과류가 들어 있나요?\",\"romanization\":\"i dijeoteue gyeongwa-ryuga deureo innayo?\"},{\"hangul\":\"견과류 있어요?\",\"romanization\":\"gyeongwa-ryu isseoyo?\"},{\"hangul\":\"견과류 빼 주세요.\",\"romanization\":\"gyeongwa-ryu ppae juseyo.\"}],\"correctAnswerIndex\":0,\"translation\":\"Are there nuts in this dessert?\",\"explanation\":\"견과류 = nuts\",\"teachingPoint\":\"Ask ingredient questions clearly\",\"explanationNarration\":\"Explain that asking about ingredients helps you avoid allergens.\"},{\"scenario\":\"At the counter\",\"prompt\":\"Ask which desserts are available without milk.\",\"context\":\"You want dairy-free options.\",\"spokenPrompt\":\"우유 없이 가능한 디저트가 어떤 게 있어요?\",\"choices\":[{\"hangul\":\"우유 없이 가능한 디저트가 어떤 게 있어요?\",\"romanization\":\"uyu eopsi ganeunghan dijeoteuga eotteon ge isseoyo?\"},{\"hangul\":\"우유 들어간 디저트 있어요?\",\"romanization\":\"uju deureogan dijeoteu isseoyo?\"},{\"hangul\":\"우유 빼고 주세요.\",\"romanization\":\"uyu ppaego juseyo.\"}],\"correctAnswerIndex\":0,\"translation\":\"Which desserts are dairy-free?\",\"explanation\":\"우유 없이 = without milk\",\"teachingPoint\":\"Ask about dairy-free options\",\"explanationNarration\":\"Identify dairy-free desserts before choosing to eat.\"},{\"scenario\":\"At the counter\",\"prompt\":\"Bonus hard question: you want to discuss sharing and request an extra plate for sharing.\",\"context\":\"Final hard task for beginners, polite request.\",\"spokenPrompt\":\"나눠 먹을 접시 하나 더 주세요.\",\"choices\":[{\"hangul\":\"나눠 먹을 접시 하나 더 주세요.\",\"romanization\":\"nanwo meogeul jeopsi hana deo juseyo.\"},{\"hangul\":\"접시 하나 주세요.\",\"romanization\":\"jeopsi hana juseyo.\"},{\"hangul\":\"포크 하나 더 주세요.\",\"romanization\":\"pokeu hana deo juseyo.\"}],\"correctAnswerIndex\":0,\"translation\":\"Please give me one more plate for sharing.\",\"explanation\":\"하나 더 주세요 = one more plate\",\"teachingPoint\":\"Request an extra plate for sharing\",\"explanationNarration\":\"Use more polite phrasing to plan sharing, avoiding direct or casual language.\"}],\"bonus\":{\"scenario\":\"Bonus hard task: private review item.\",\"prompt\":\"Determine a private answer index and rationale for creator review only.\",\"context\":\"No public hints, for creator use.\",\"spokenPrompt\":\"\",\"choices\":[{\"hangul\":\"나눠 먹을 접시 하나 더 주세요.\",\"romanization\":\"nanwo meogeul jeopsi hana deo juseyo.\"},{\"hangul\":\"메뉴 오늘 다 팔려요?\",\"romanization\":\"menyu oneul daryeoyo?\"},{\"hangul\":\"케이크가 남았나요?\",\"romanization\":\"keikeuga namonnayo?\"}],\"correctAnswerIndex\":0,\"translation\":\"Please give one more plate for sharing (private answer).\",\"explanation\":\"This item is used for creator review to confirm difficulty level and teaching point alignment.\",\"teachingPoint\":\"Private review note for content quality and alignment.\"}}"
